  "body": "Your new lifestyle begins here at an affordable $630k ono.\r\n\r\nYou wouldn't dream you could buy in this location at such an affordable price.\r\n\r\nExperience the vibrant lifestyle you’ve been searching for in this beautifully presented one-bedroom apartment, perfectly positioned in the pulse of Takapuna’s thriving community.. \r\n\r\nThe resort-style facilities  make everyday living extraordinary – take a dip in the sparkling pool, energize your mornings in the fully-equipped gym, or challenge friends on the tennis court. With exclusive access to these amenities, your well-being is always a priority.\r\n\r\nThe covered carparking gives easy access to the large welcoming foyer. Such a great asset in an inner city environment.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a busy professional or looking for a safe urban base, this apartment offers the ideal blend of comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing and take the next step toward calling this stunning property your new home!",
